1
00:00:00,558 --> 00:00:02,858
(Sheldon:)This is ridiculous.
We're shopping for a party.

2
00:00:03,027 --> 00:00:04,787
This store doesn't have a party section.

3
00:00:04,962 --> 00:00:07,262
(Penny:)Yeah, it does, and here we are.

4
00:00:09,433 --> 00:00:12,993
(Sheldon:)I have to say, Penny,
I don't understand why you, of all people...

5
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:15,070
(Sheldon:)...are encouraging Leonard to do this.

6
00:00:15,239 --> 00:00:17,999
(Penny:)Well, I'm his girlfriend,
of course I'm gonna support him.

7
00:00:18,175 --> 00:00:20,165
(Sheldon:)Well, you're his girlfriend for now.

8
00:00:20,378 --> 00:00:24,838
(Sheldon:)Maybe you're not aware of this,
but there is a rich tradition of men at sea...

9
00:00:25,016 --> 00:00:28,416
(Sheldon:)...finding comfort in each other's arms
and britches.

10
00:00:30,755 --> 00:00:32,985
(Penny:)Honey, this is a big deal for Leonard, okay?

11
00:00:33,157 --> 00:00:37,887
(Penny:)He gets to work with Stephen Hawking, who,
by the way, will not be on the boat, I checked.

12
00:00:38,663 --> 00:00:42,653
It's not that big of an opportunity. I mean,
even if Hawking's theories are correct...

13
00:00:42,833 --> 00:00:45,203
(Sheldon:)...all they prove is
where the universe came from...

14
00:00:45,403 --> 00:00:49,003
(Sheldon:)...why everything exists
and what its ultimate end will be.

15
00:00:49,306 --> 00:00:54,026
(Sheldon:)Me? I'm interested in the big questions.

